          "documentation": "Corrected event CSV: CaseId, Activity, Actor; order channel comes from the source file. No customer identity or timestamp is available. Sales IDs are not case IDs. In the global view this is a shared information concept for every applicable branch; a representative association is drawn to keep the diagram readable.",
