        {
          "cost": 0.0,
          "documentation": "The Sales worksheets record Pizza Type and Pizza Size. Using those fields as a preparation specification is an authored information-flow assumption; there is no row-level sales-to-case join. In the global view this is a shared information concept for every applicable branch; a representative association is drawn to keep the diagram readable.",
