          "documentation": "PizzasInfo: 18 type/size entries, recorded cost and revenue. Monetary unit is unspecified. The association with settlement describes a proposed information interface, not a recorded data exchange. In the global view this is a shared information concept for every applicable branch; a representative association is drawn to keep the diagram readable.",
