          "documentation": "Sales fields: Id, StructureId, Pizza Type, Pizza Size, Revenue, Cost, Satisfaction, Weekday, Customer Location, Customer Type. This is a sales record, not proof of a distinct customer or an event-log transaction. Cached Excel values are used; formulas are never executed. In the global view this is a shared information concept for every applicable branch; a representative association is drawn to keep the diagram readable.",
