        {
          "cost": 0.0,
          "documentation": "Customer Location is a geographic category in Sales, not a street address or a case-linked delivery instruction. Its proposed use in planning is an explicit modeling assumption. In the global view this is a shared information concept for every applicable branch; a representative association is drawn to keep the diagram readable.",
